{"about_the_game":"CoopScoop is a VR arcade-style game that revolves around managing a chicken farm. A chicken epidemic has broken out and you need to make sure all your chickens stay healthy and happy. Wash your chickens, cure the infected ones and quarantine the green chickens! Keep your chickens alive for as long as you can, because that\u2019s how we do it chicken-farmer-style!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> \ud83d\udc14 <strong>Chicken Farming</strong>:<br>Experience the joys and challenges of running a chicken farm. Test your management abilities and decision-making in a high-stakes farming simulation.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672620/extras/5e5677e8f7a354de57c10f6bc7e89bdd.poster.avif?t=1747082116\" width=590 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672620/extras/5e5677e8f7a354de57c10f6bc7e89bdd.webm?t=1747082116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672620/extras/5e5677e8f7a354de57c10f6bc7e89bdd.mp4?t=1747082116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></li><li> \ud83c\udf3e <strong>Epidemic Survival</strong>:<br>A chicken virus is sweeping the country, and it's up to you to keep your flock healthy and happy. Wash, feed, and care for your chickens to prevent infection.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672620/extras/ada9bf541b372ed6286930990ae18dab.poster.avif?t=1747082116\" width=590 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672620/extras/ada9bf541b372ed6286930990ae18dab.webm?t=1747082116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672620/extras/ada9bf541b372ed6286930990ae18dab.mp4?t=1747082116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Will you rise to the occasion and save your chickens from the epidemic? Get ready to embark on your CoopScoop journey today and show the world your farming prowess!</strong></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2672620?t=1747082116","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2672620?t=1747082116","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672620/d4975b937ae0aa0c81513048306482768e6ebeaa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747082116","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672620/d4975b937ae0aa0c81513048306482768e6ebeaa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747082116","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3709400,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"CoopScoop is a VR arcade-style game that revolves around managing a chicken farm. A chicken epidemic has broken out and you need to make sure all your chickens stay healthy and happy. Wash your chickens, cure the infected ones and quarantine the green chickens! Keep your chickens alive for as long as you can, because that\u2019s how we do it chicken-farmer-style!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> \ud83d\udc14 <strong>Chicken Farming</strong>:<br>Experience the joys and challenges of running a chicken farm. Test your management abilities and decision-making in a high-